## Conventions enforced for agents

{{Optional. Things you've explicitly told agents in this repo and don't
want to repeat. Examples:}}

- **Never commit a secret.** Credentials reach the app through
  environment variables and the deploy scripts that read them.
- Unit tests live alongside the code they cover (`{{path pattern}}`)
  and are owned by the `implementer` agent. Integration and
  acceptance tests live in a separate tree and are owned by the
  `testwriter` agent — see `.harness/pack/agents/README.md` for the
  file-ownership matrix.
- All cross-feature decisions are recorded as ADRs in
  `specifications/{{version}}/`. Use `ADR-NNN-<feature>.md` for
  feature-scoped ADRs and `ADR-EXX-<feature>.md` for epic-scoped ones.
  A decision settled in chat and not written down does not exist.

